<title>LITHUANIA: Lithuanian 28-day T-bill yields edge up.</title>
<headline>Lithuanian 28-day T-bill yields edge up.</headline>
<dateline>VILNIUS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on 28-day Lithuanian Treasury bills edged up at Tuesday's auction but the issue was oversubscribed, the central bank said.</p>
<p>All amounts are in millions of litas.</p>
<p> MATURITY    AV YIELD   (LAST TIME)   MIN/MAX   ISSUE  BID  SOLD</p>
<p> 28-days	9.53	  8.68	 8.87/10.30   40   75.8  40</p>
<p>Settlement date for today's auction is November 8 and the paper matures on December 6.</p>
<p>-- Riga newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
</text>
